<title>USA: Lightbridge Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Lightbridge Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.11			nil</p>
<p> Net			  1,768			 23</p>
<p> Revs			 8,823		    6,314</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,422		   13,334</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company reported pro forma earnings per share and average number of shares outstanding for the first quarter of 1996 because of its initial public offering in September 1996.</p>
<p>Net income for the first quarter of 1997 included an income tax benefit of $1.1 million from the release of a deferred tax valuation allowance and utilization of tax credits.</p>
